# T4 · NEW-042 폴더 비교(10-05 §63 · a39d3a1): 좌 left · 우 right → 배경 메뉴 ▸ 반대 패널과 폴더 비교 → 창 열림 · 결과 = 왼쪽만 a · 오른쪽만 b · same 같음.
id: compare-folders
title: 두 패널 폴더 비교 — 판정 표
tree: file left/a.txt 3
tree: file left/same.txt 2
tree: file right/b.txt 4
tree: file right/same.txt 2
settings: ui.lang=en
cmd: @ready:panel:1
cmd: @ready:nav:<root>/right
cmd: @ready:panel:0
cmd: @ready:nav:<root>/left
cmd: @ready:ui.rclick:@panel0.list
cmd: @ready:ctx.wait
cmd: @ready:ctx.dump:<out>/menu.txt
cmd: @ready:ctx.pick:ctx.compare_panels
cmd: @ready:compare.wait
cmd: @ready:compare.dump:<out>/cmp.txt
cmd: @ready:quit
check: menu.txt: ctx.compare_panels
check: cmp.txt: open true
check: cmp.txt: running false
check: cmp.txt: entry a.txt OnlyLeft
check: cmp.txt: entry b.txt OnlyRight
check: cmp.txt: entry same.txt Same
check: cmp.txt: status 3 items · 2 differ (left only 1 · right only 1
